  "body": "Found while working #548 (Sinker EDM machine page).\n\nThe Machine window edits the mounted machine through the undoable `EditMachineApply` (-> `LoadMachine`, validated by `Machine::is_sane`). An agent can only mount a machine file (`load_machine`); it cannot state or change a machine's `edm` section (orbits, conditions, `edm.codes`) headlessly.\n\nAdd an MCP tool over the same command: take a machine edit (at minimum the `edm` section: max_orbit_radius, pickup, orbits, conditions, codes), refuse what `is_sane` refuses by name, one undo step.\n\nDone means: an MCP session can add a condition to a mounted sinker machine and undo it; pinned by an mcp test.\n",
